WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:10.801
Once there was a bear who lived in a meadow.

2
00:00:11.721 --> 00:00:13.042
He was very big.

3
00:00:13.542 --> 00:00:16.143
And he was always very hungry.

4
00:00:16.864 --> 00:00:18.264
His name was Bo Bo.

5
00:00:19.205 --> 00:00:21.526
One day, Bo Bo smelled honey.

6
00:00:21.946 --> 00:00:24.227
He followed his nose to a tree.

7
00:00:24.867 --> 00:00:26.048
Then he looked up.

8
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:30.721
There he saw a huge beehive hanging on a branch!

9
00:00:30.741 --> 00:00:32.662
"My lucky day!"

10
00:00:33.122 --> 00:00:33.642
he said.

11
00:00:34.502 --> 00:00:37.203
Carefully, Bo Bo climbed the tree.

12
00:00:37.883 --> 00:00:41.585
And, carefully, he climbed out onto the branch.

13
00:00:42.305 --> 00:00:44.285
But Bo Bo was too heavy.

14
00:00:44.966 --> 00:00:46.206
The branch broke.

15
00:00:47.206 --> 00:00:50.707
Down he fell, with the beehive, to the ground.

16
00:00:53.164 --> 00:00:57.086
THUMP! The bees came out, and started to chase Bo Bo.

17
00:00:57.626 --> 00:00:58.867
Bo Bo ran away.

18
00:00:59.868 --> 00:01:01.889
He ran faster and faster.

19
00:01:01.909 --> 00:01:05.511
"HELP ME!"

20
00:01:05.891 --> 00:01:06.531
he screamed.

21
00:01:06.551 --> 00:01:09.753
"Somebody help me!"

22
00:01:10.453 --> 00:01:13.255
Freddy the frog heard Bo Bo screaming.

23
00:01:14.335 --> 00:01:15.796
Then he saw the bees.

24
00:01:15.816 --> 00:01:18.758
"Quick! Jump in the pond!"

25
00:01:19.458 --> 00:01:20.178
Freddy yelled.

26
00:01:21.179 --> 00:01:24.901
Bo Bo jumped right in, and the bees flew away.

27
00:01:29.043 --> 00:01:32.065
you!" said Bo Bo when he came up for air.

28
00:01:32.085 --> 00:01:34.587
"You saved my life!"

29
00:01:35.547 --> 00:01:38.149
"You're welcome," said Freddy kindly.

30
00:01:38.169 --> 00:01:40.470
"This pond is my home.

31
00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:42.931
You were lucky to be running this way.

32
00:01:43.452 --> 00:01:44.993
Can I ask you a question?"

33
00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:47.654
"Sure," said Bo Bo.

34
00:01:47.674 --> 00:01:50.676
"Why were those bees chasing you?"

35
00:01:51.708 --> 00:01:53.909
Bo Bo scratched his fuzzy head.

36
00:01:53.929 --> 00:01:55.530
"I don't know.

37
00:01:56.131 --> 00:01:57.551
Maybe they were angry."

38
00:01:58.232 --> 00:02:00.693
Freddy was smarter than most frogs.

39
00:02:01.494 --> 00:02:04.075
And he was definitely smarter than Bo Bo.

40
00:02:04.095 --> 00:02:07.437
"I bet you wanted their honey, right?"

41
00:02:07.977 --> 00:02:08.457
he asked.

42
00:02:08.477 --> 00:02:13.500
"Oh yeah," Bo Bo remembered sadly.

43
00:02:14.581 --> 00:02:15.962
Freddy thought for a moment.

44
00:02:16.982 --> 00:02:18.643
He felt sorry for the bear.

45
00:02:19.564 --> 00:02:21.704
Then he said, "Are you hungry?

46
00:02:22.444 --> 00:02:27.186
I know where you can catch some tasty fish, and I can catch some tasty flies."

47
00:02:28.146 --> 00:02:29.366
He licked his lips.

48
00:02:30.527 --> 00:02:32.847
"Sure!" said Bo Bo happily.

49
00:02:34.008 --> 00:02:35.888
He followed Freddy to a stream.

50
00:02:35.908 --> 00:02:41.330
"There are lots of fish here," said Freddy.

51
00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:44.110
"Just wait and you'll see."

52
00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.291
Bo Bo waited.

53
00:02:47.031 --> 00:02:49.112
Soon he saw lots of fish.

54
00:02:50.144 --> 00:02:51.125
Better than honey!

55
00:02:51.905 --> 00:02:54.687
He jumped into the water to grab a fish.

56
00:02:55.527 --> 00:02:57.729
But then he heard Freddy screaming.

57
00:02:58.949 --> 00:03:00.430
Bo Bo dropped the fish.

58
00:03:01.531 --> 00:03:03.952
He saw a snake hissing at Freddy.

59
00:03:03.972 --> 00:03:09.675
"GRRRRRR!" Bo Bo growled at the snake.

60
00:03:10.496 --> 00:03:11.957
The snake slipped away.

61
00:03:11.977 --> 00:03:17.340
"Th-th-thank you," Freddy said, shaking all over.

62
00:03:18.652 --> 00:03:20.052
"You saved my life."

63
00:03:20.072 --> 00:03:22.273
"That's what friends are for.

64
00:03:22.713 --> 00:03:25.134
They help each other," said Bo Bo.

65
00:03:25.154 --> 00:03:27.855
"Does that mean we're friends now?"

66
00:03:27.875 --> 00:03:30.615
"Yes, I think it does."

67
00:03:31.235 --> 00:03:32.076
Freddy smiled.

68
00:03:32.096 --> 00:03:34.136
"Let's catch some dinner.

69
00:03:34.436 --> 00:03:35.097
I'm hungry."

70
00:03:35.737 --> 00:03:40.538
They had a great time catching as many fish and flies as they wanted.

71
00:03:41.018 --> 00:03:44.159
Freddy showed Bo Bo where all the fish were hiding.

72
00:03:45.199 --> 00:03:47.500
And Bo Bo scared away the snakes.

73
00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:54.104
The two friends sat on the bank of the stream, watching the sun set over the hill.

74
00:03:54.124 --> 00:03:58.248
"I'm glad I met you," said Bo Bo.

75
00:03:58.268 --> 00:04:01.910
"I'm glad I met you," said Freddy.

76
00:04:02.891 --> 00:04:07.314
Then after a while he said, "This is only the beginning."

77
00:04:07.334 --> 00:04:09.816
"The beginning of what?"

78
00:04:10.597 --> 00:04:11.217
asked Bo Bo.

79
00:04:11.237 --> 00:04:14.800
"Of our friendship," said Freddy.

80
00:04:16.209 --> 00:04:20.110
And they watched the sun set, feeling full and happy.
